  <prompt>
    Reconcile the three UAT round-2 button labels (owner, 2026-08-11) in the SHIPPED reconcile components against the
    owner's requested wording. The UAT feedback referenced the PROTOTYPE labels; the shipped components have already
    diverged in places, so this is a reconciliation, not a blind rename. Apply ONLY the three label changes below +
    their test updates. Do NOT touch behavior, routing, or add new surfaces (those are tasks 064-066, gated on sign-off).
  </prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE frontend developer. Expert in @spaarke/communication-components + Fluent v9 + RTL. Follow ADRs strictly. Make the minimal, exact change requested — nothing above-and-beyond.</role>
  <goal>
    The three reconcile surfaces show the owner-approved labels with test parity: Related-to create tile = "+ New record"
    (Add icon, consistent with "+ New task"); Fields proposal primary = "Accept" (verify already present); Tasks proposal
    primary = "Create" (changed from the shipped "Accept" — honoring the explicit E3a request; Fields stays "Accept").
  </goal>

  <context>
